OL,5,G0245 Steam Train Britain
OL,6,     FOn the Welsh Highland Railway,
OL,7,     Ftrainee Claire Oates takes her
OL,8,     Fdriving test, while chef Alex and
OL,9,     Fmanager Michelle prepare a dinner
OL,10,     Ffor 130 people on the East
OL,11,     FLancashire railway.
OL,12,G0330 Steam Train Britain
OL,13,     FAt the East Lancashire Railway,
OL,14,     Fthe annual Race the Train event
OL,15,     Fgets under way - with athletes of
OL,16,     Fall abilities taking on the
OL,17,     F11-mile course from Bury to
OL,18,     FRawtenstall.
